{"1564220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary", "steam_appid": 1564220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Q.U.B.E. Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>RTX AND DLSS ENABLED!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/d180164b4c9c3ab9efac4262706748e7.avif?t=1744827502\" width=612 height=108 /></span></p><br><h1>Q.U.B.E. Create included!</h1><p>Create, share, and play custom levels with the in-game sandbox level editor!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/0a81a363f88404aca637f1de461898cb.poster.avif?t=1744827502\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/0a81a363f88404aca637f1de461898cb.webm?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/0a81a363f88404aca637f1de461898cb.mp4?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW: NOW INCLUDES LEVEL EDITOR!</strong></h2>Create your own mind bending puzzles with Q.U.B.E. Create and share them in the Steam Workshop, included free with Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary!<br><br><br>Serving as the ultimate celebration of a decade’s worth of brain-twisting first-person action, Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary adds refined visuals, completely redesigned and revised gameplay sections, and a whole new chapter to a fresh take on the classic puzzler entirely rebuilt from the ground up.<br><br>The new chapter - dubbed Sector 8 - offers an additional 4-6 hours of gameplay, adding fresh content to an anniversary edition that will also allow players to take on either the original 2012 version of the game, or 2014’s Director’s Cut complete with its voice-over narrative and revised soundtrack - both with Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary’s stunning new visuals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/994d1fe2bcecafd2ab773017415210e6.poster.avif?t=1744827502\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/994d1fe2bcecafd2ab773017415210e6.webm?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/994d1fe2bcecafd2ab773017415210e6.mp4?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q.U.B.E. 10th Anniversary features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Q.U.B.E. - The original - The 2012 version of the game with improved visuals, new puzzles and gameplay tweaks from player feedback.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Q.U.B.E. Director’s Cut - The 2014 version of the game with a voice-over narrative and revised soundtrack.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 100 puzzles to complete across 8 levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sector 8 - A whole new chapter to the game, unlocked after completing the campaign. This provides 4-6 hours of brand new puzzle gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fresh visuals, with the game entirely rebuilt from the ground up</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>46 Collectibles to track down across 8 levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full colour blind support, using symbols as a colour aid</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brand New Developer Commentary - The dev team reminisces about how they made the game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Assorted Extras - Screenshots, concept art, and other trinkets from the making of the game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>RTX and DLSS support.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Includes Q.U.B.E. Create level editor!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/149ba763067bd15d7563624fbfa4e6cf.poster.avif?t=1744827502\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/149ba763067bd15d7563624fbfa4e6cf.webm?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/149ba763067bd15d7563624fbfa4e6cf.mp4?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q.U.B.E. Create includes the following:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Duplicate objects easily</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Translate, Rotate, and Scale objects!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Select objects via an Object List!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Select from categories: Puzzle, Geometry, Props, Lights</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Puzzle elements ranging the entire franchise!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steam Workshop integration!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Attach, connect, and activate objects!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Change their properties!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Select level music!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Change world lighting</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>PLAYER DEATH!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics Bot!</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/0a81a363f88404aca637f1de461898cb.poster.avif?t=1744827502\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564220/extras/0a81a363f88404aca637f1de461898cb.webm?t=1744827502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc